1-LANE Ethernet Modes,
    10GBASE_KR, 25GBASE_CR, 25GBASE_CR_C,
    25GBASE_KR, 25GBASE_KR_C, 50GBASE_CR, 50GBASE_KR
2-LANE Ethernet Modes,
    50GBASE_CR2_C, 50GBASE_KR2_C,
    100GBASE_CR2, 100GBASE_KR2,
4-LANE Ethernet Modes,
    40GBASE_CR4, 40GBASE_KR4,
    100GBASE_CR4, 100GBASE_KR4,
