␀Set the 802.3ap FEC ability advertisement of a PORT.
Note: This setting is only used when PORT-MODE = 802_3AP.
Note: This only affects 10Gb/s per lane modes (e.g. 10GBASE-KR, 40GBASE-KR4).
and Ethernet Consortium technologies.
Note: A maximum of 10 configurations are supported per PORT.
