␀DDR5 refresh mode temperature
Valid values:
    0:  For lower tempperature(0 < TCASE <85c) - it will set the
        tREFI to 3.9us in case of DDR5-REFRESH-MODE = "0"(normal
        mode) and for 1.95us in case of DDR5-REFRESH-MODE = "1"
        (FGR mode and SBR mode)
    1:  Extended temprature(85c < TCASE <95c) - it will set the
        tREFI to 1.95us in case of DDR5-REFRESH-MODE = "0"(normal
        mode) and for 975ns in case of DDR5-REFRESH-MODE = "1"
        (FGR mode and SBR mode)
    2:  TCR (Temperature Control Refresh) Mode
Default value is 0.
